  "description": "After finally putting an end to his long period of unemployment, Jin Foster heads confidently to his new job. \n\nBut his boss turns out to be his ex-lover?!\n\nBetween an unexpectedly started cohabitation and a constantly noisy couple next door, Jin’s once quiet daily life begins to change…\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3092033718), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61671973), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/invariable)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/133475)",
